Attribution for the specification text (CC BY 4.0, section 3(a)(1)): you must give appropriate
credit, provide a link to the licence, and indicate if changes were made. A convenient form:

  "MARTELAGE-0.1 — The Evidence Package Standard" by the Martelage authors, CC BY 4.0.
  Changes: <none | describe>

The test vectors under vectors/ are part of the specification's conformance material and are
released under CC BY 4.0 with it.

A third party claims conformance by publishing a statement in its own name that its producer emits
packages conformant with "martelage 0.1", naming the requirement identifiers it relies on and any it does
not satisfy with the reason. No registration, permission or fee is required, and no certification by
the Martelage authors is implied. The template is Annex C of spec/MARTELAGE-0.1.md.

There is no warranty. The standard states its own limits in §3; read them before relying on a
package.
